  "as_of_notes": "Data 'Information as of 06/08/2026' per the 'Reg Voter' worksheet header in the PA DOS currentvotestats.xlsx file. PA DOS publishes updated voter registration statistics weekly (each Monday).",
  "data_quality": "high; official PA Department of State weekly Excel report (currentvotestats.xlsx), 'Reg Voter' tab. All 67 counties present. Every county party breakdown (Dem+Rep+NoAff+Other) equals county total; statewide party sums equal statewide total (8,956,598) and match the file's own Totals row exactly.",
  "notes": "Party categories from source: Dem=Democratic, Rep=Republican, No Aff=No Affiliation, Other=all other/minor parties combined. Per PA DOS note, the 'No Affiliation' column counts only voters with that exact designation. Counts include both active and inactive registered voters. Statewide totals: Democratic 3,834,280; Republican 3,641,144; No Affiliation 1,165,555; Other 315,619."
